NODE_ENV=development
PORT=4000
JWT_SECRET=dev_super_secret_change_me
DATABASE_URL=postgres://localhost:5432/oyasumi_2

# Database team (Neon) — per scripts/pull-db-from-neon.sh; non committare
# NEON_DATABASE_URL=postgres://...@ep-....neon.tech/oyasumi-db?sslmode=require&options=-c%20search_path%3Dpublic
# LOCAL_DATABASE_URL=postgres://localhost:5432/oyasumi_2

# Client Next.js (default API: http://localhost:4000)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
# APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Sessione httpOnly: cookie `oyasumi_session` impostato al login.
# In produzione (Render): SameSite=None; Secure. In locale: SameSite=Lax.
# Il client usa credentials: "include" — non salvare più JWT in localStorage.

# --- Web Push PWA ---
# Genera coppia VAPID con: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys --json
# WEB_PUSH_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=...
# WEB_PUSH_VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=...
# WEB_PUSH_VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:oyasumi.staff@gmail.com

# --- Email (scegli UN provider; auto = gmail-api > resend > gmail-smtp) ---
# EMAIL_PROVIDER=gmail-api   # opzionale: forza gmail-api | resend | gmail-smtp
# REGISTRATION_NOTIFY_EMAIL=oyasumi.staff@gmail.com
# EMAIL_REPLY_TO=oyasumi.staff@gmail.com

# A) Gmail API OAuth (consigliato su Render free — nessun dominio, HTTPS)
# Google Cloud: abilita Gmail API, OAuth client desktop, redirect http://localhost:8765/oauth/callback
# Poi: cd apps/server && bun run gmail-oauth-setup
# GMAIL_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=xxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
# GMAIL_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-xxx
# GMAIL_OAUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN=1//xxx
# EMAIL_USER=oyasumi.staff@gmail.com

# B) Resend (richiede dominio verificato per mail ai nuovi iscritti; @resend.dev = solo account owner)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxx
# EMAIL_FROM=Oyasumi <noreply@tuodominio.it>

# C) Gmail SMTP (solo sviluppo locale — Render free blocca porte 465/587)
# EMAIL_USER=oyasumi.staff@gmail.com
# EMAIL_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
